@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-xl-9">
        <div class="mb-4">
            <p class="text-primary fw-semibold mb-1">STAFFMANAGEMENT PORTAL</p>
            <h1 class="mb-2">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
            <p class="lead text-muted mb-0">This page explains what information the portal handles and how it is used to support staff management.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <h2 class="h5">Information in the portal</h2>
                <p>The portal may contain account and contact details, employee and job information, department and designation, project assignments, timesheets, leave requests, and expense records. Leave applications may include a reason or supporting document.</p>
                <p class="mb-0">Please enter only information needed for the relevant work request. Avoid including unnecessary medical, financial, or other private details in free-text fields.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <h2 class="h5">How information is used</h2>
                <p class="mb-0">Information is used to manage staff accounts and records, assign projects, record daily work, and submit or review leave and expense requests. Timesheet, project, and request information is shown according to the access granted to the employee, their manager, HR, and administrators.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <h2 class="h5">Access and account security</h2>
                <p>Access to portal information depends on the account role and the employee’s assignments. Keep your sign-in details private, sign out when using a shared device, and contact HR or the system administrator if you think someone has accessed your account.</p>
                <p class="mb-0">Do not use another person’s account or share information from the portal with people who do not need it for their work.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <h2 class="h5">Retention and corrections</h2>
                <p class="mb-0">Portal records are retained and managed under the organization’s applicable records and retention practices. Contact HR or the system administrator to request a correction to your employee information or to ask how a record is handled.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="alert alert-light border mb-0" role="note">
            <strong>Questions?</strong> Contact your HR team or system administrator through your organization’s usual support channel.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
